SUMMARY:The Proper Way and Celebrating our 10th Birthday Party
DESCRIPTION:Music @ The Collective &amp\; Our 10th Birthday Party!!\nWe are thrilled to have The Proper Way at The Local Artisan Collective for out 10th Birthday Party!!\nGet Ready to Feel the Beat at Music @ The Collective!\nJoin us for a foot-tapping\, heart-thumping\, soul-filling good time at Music @ The Collective—a FREE monthly celebration of local talent\, creativity\, and community vibes!\n5:00 to 7:00:\nThe Proper Way began as a duo of multi-instrumentalists/singers Shane Osguthorpe and Scott Rogers in 2016. Fellow multi-instrumentalist/singer Carrie Myers completed the band in 2018\, forming this powerful Ogden\, Utah based trio.\nThanks Ogden City Arts and OFOAM – Ogden Friends of Acoustic Music for sponsoring this event.\nFeaturing:\nIncredible local musicians\nHands-on art demos\nAn all-ages experience\nA vibrant\, welcoming space for everyone\nWhere: 2371 Kiesel Ave.\, Ogden\nWhen: Monthly during the Art Stroll &amp\; special events\nExact times will vary every event\nCost: FREE (Yes\, really!)\n\nThis calendar listing is brought to you by NowPlayingUtah.com\, Utah&#8217\;s one-stop\, online website for arts and entertainment events\, powered by the Utah Cultural Alliance.
LOCATION:2371 Kiesel Ave\, Ogden\, UT 84401
URL:https://nowplayingutah.com/event/the-proper-way-and-celebrating-our-10th-birthday-party/
DTSTAMP:20261016T215710Z
END:VEVENT
